# Runs inside the worker container (TZ=America/New_York). supercronic logs every run to stdout.
# Weekdays 7:00: fetch, filter, score, tailor 30, render, queue, morning push
0 7 * * 1-5 jobagent run daily
# Every 2 hours, 9:00 to 21:00: read Gmail, log replies, build interview kits
0 9-21/2 * * * jobagent run inbox
# Weekdays 19:00: evening digest (rejections bundled here)
0 19 * * 1-5 jobagent notify --digest evening
# Sundays 9:00: discover new companies, re-check which board each company uses
0 9 * * 0 jobagent run discover
# Nightly 23:30: copy data/ and out/ to the private data repo
30 23 * * * /app/scripts/backup.sh
